AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_195325> "A thirteen amino acid peptide hormone consisting of <em>N</em>-acetyl-<small>L</small>-Ser, <small>L</small>-Tyr, <small>L</small>-Ser, <small>L</small>-Met, <small>L</small>-Glu, <small>L</small>-His, <small>L</small>-Phe, <small>L</small>-Arg, <small>L</small>-Trp, Gly, <small>L</small>-Lys, <small>L</small>-Pro and <small>L</small>-valinamide units joined in sequence by peptide linkages. It is an endogenous melanocortin receptor agonist that exhibits anti-inflammatory activity.")
