AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#inSubset> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_27314> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/3_STAR>)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_27314> "water-soluble vitamin (role)")
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_27314> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_33229>)

